    {
      "id": "invariants_text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75,
      "y": 464,
      "width": 690,
      "height": 380,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 122,
      "text": "Non-negotiable contracts\n\n• Clause order and query nesting survive parsing.\n\n• Every symbol has an identity, scope and type.\n\n• Optional MATCH is a correlated LeftApply—not a flag.\n\n• Quantified paths remain one LogicalPathExpand—not\n  an explosion of complete plans.\n\n• Mutations are operators in one transaction plan—not\n  sidecars or independently executed statements.\n\n• MVCC tables are authoritative; CSR is disposable.\n\n• A verifier checks every compiler boundary.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "invariants",
      "boundElements": null
    },
